BT /F1 10 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 55 635 Tm (2. Locate the first data sector from reserved sectors and FAT copies; the root directory) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 55 618.5 Tm (lives in a cluster chain, not in a fixed pre-data root area.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 55 592 Tm (3. FAT32 uses 32-bit table entries with only the low 28 bits for cluster values. Preserve) Tj ET
