BT /F1 10 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 55 532.5 Tm (selected; do not assume both FATs are always written in the same way.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 55 506 Tm (5. Interpret FSInfo free-cluster count and next-free hint as advisory values. They can be) Tj ET
