BT /F1 10 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 55 575.5 Tm (3. Follow each file and directory chain with cycle detection and an upper traversal) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 55 559 Tm (bound; a damaged FAT link must not cause unbounded I/O.) Tj ET
